@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080

### 200 OK with a caller-supplied correlation ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/examples/1
X-Correlation-Id: demo-correlation-123

### 200 OK with pagination metadata and a generated correlation ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/examples/page?page=2&pageSize=2

### 404 Not Found with a business error
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/examples/999

### 422 Unprocessable Entity with two field errors
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/examples/validate
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"","quantity":0}

### 200 OK with a validated request
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/examples/validate
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Notebook","quantity":2}

### 500 Internal Server Error with a technical error
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/examples/unexpected-error
X-Correlation-Id: demo-error-123

### Create an auditable process
# @name createProcess
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/processes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "processTypeId": 1,
  "processStatusId": 1,
  "clientNif": "123456789",
  "clientName": "Example Client",
  "clientSector": "Retail",
  "clientCountryCode": "PT",
  "comments": "Created",
  "userId": 1
}

### Update the process created above
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/processes/{{createProcess.response.body.$.data.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "processTypeId": 1,
  "processStatusId": 2,
  "clientNif": "123456789",
  "clientName": "Example Client",
  "clientSector": "Retail",
  "clientCountryCode": "PT",
  "comments": "Updated",
  "userId": 2
}

### Delete the process
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/processes/{{createProcess.response.body.$.data.id}}

### Verify the Insert, Update, and Delete snapshots
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/processes/{{createProcess.response.body.$.data.id}}/history
